{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/8304a0db163d4a905af54f72ba9519fe.poster.avif?t=1755600496\" width=750 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/8304a0db163d4a905af54f72ba9519fe.webm?t=1755600496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/8304a0db163d4a905af54f72ba9519fe.mp4?t=1755600496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend the islands and earn your wings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a faraway island, young Pekkus train on a vibrant climbing course built just for them in order to earn their wings and find someone to share the skies with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pekku is a vibrant 3d precision platformer with multiple islands to discover. Explore floating islands and mountains; Stumble across creatures both friendly and unfriendly; and climb your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/73fe582f6830c7b329e4f1d898f765b6.avif?t=1755600496\" width=630 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 3D platformer with unique pecking mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tightly tuned 3D controls. Peck, double jump, glide your way through the toughest climbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and interract with multiple other pekkus learning to climb on the same island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple islands with unique platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to put each mechanic to use! Diving, perfect jumps and many more tools to guide your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a huge amount of collectibles that can be used to customize your pekku.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find several cute creatures that can help or hurt you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big bright vibrant colorful design for each unique island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your overall progress in the main world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race other players through a procedurally generated course.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/fce27124173e362c7c012d66011f08c7.avif?t=1755600496\" width=630 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world crafted with love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Pekku is hand crafted, carefully thought out, full of secrets with much attention to detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new area is filled with multiple paths, creatures and special blocks, take in the sights as you climb to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like 3D platformers, cute characters, difficult climbs and beautiful worlds, then Pekku awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/3126e722475745a3a03a4aaf6b5c836d.avif?t=1755600496\" width=630 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410140/extras/3b70e8d50571c735f99703acf5c5f2db.avif?t=1755600496\" width=630 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s